<section class="phero phero--kits" data-section="page-banner">
  <div class="phero__media"><img src="{{ 'hero-jacket.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" fetchpriority="high"></div>
  <div class="phero__content wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Custom Kits</span></nav>
    <h1 class="phero__title"><span class="line"><span class="split">Custom kits</span></span></h1>
    <p class="phero__lede">Training kit, travel wear, bags and a supporters' shop, built around your crest. Every kit we make sends 5% back to grassroots football.</p>
    <div class="phero__ctas">
      <a href="#builder" class="btn btn--light magnetic"><span>Build your range</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      <a href="#brief" class="btn btn--ghost magnetic"><span>Skip to the brief</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHO FOR ============ -->
<section class="levels wrap" aria-label="Who we kit" data-section="levels">
  <p class="levels__label">Built for</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Semi-pro &amp; USL League Two</li>
    <li>Academies</li>
    <li>High school &amp; college</li>
    <li>Amateur &amp; Sunday league</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- ============ RANGE BUILDER ============ -->
<section class="builder" id="builder" data-section="range-builder">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="builder__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Range builder</p>
        <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Pick your pieces</span></span></h2>
      </div>
      <p>Filter by what your club needs and add pieces to your brief. We'll draw every one of them around your crest and colors.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="filters builder__filters" id="needFilters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by need"></div>
    <div class="bgrid" id="builderGrid"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="tray" id="tray" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="tray__inner wrap">
      <div class="tray__picks" id="trayPicks"></div>
      <p class="tray__count"><b id="trayCount">0</b> pieces in your brief</p>
      <a href="#brief" class="btn btn--light btn--sm"><span>Continue to brief</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PROCESS ============ -->
<section class="process" id="process" data-section="multicolumn">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="process__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">From crest</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">to kit bag.</span></span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="process__rail"><span id="processLine"></span></div>
    <ol class="process__steps">
      <li class="pstep"><span class="pstep__dot"></span><h3>Brief</h3><p>Send us your crest, colors and squad list. Tell us what you train in, what you travel in and what your supporters want.</p></li>
      <li class="pstep"><span class="pstep__dot"></span><h3>Design &amp; samples</h3><p>We draw the full range around your crest and send samples, so the squad can feel the fit before anything goes into production.</p></li>
      <li class="pstep"><span class="pstep__dot"></span><h3>Production</h3><p>Names, numbers and crests applied piece by piece. Every order arrives packed by player, ready to hand out at training.</p></li>
      <li class="pstep"><span class="pstep__dot"></span><h3>Club shop live</h3><p>Your supporters' shop goes online with the same crest and colors. We handle stock and shipping, and reorders take a click.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ INCLUDED ============ -->
<section class="included wrap" data-section="included">
  <figure class="included__img" data-reveal><img src="{{ 'armband.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Captain's armband with the Kulars K beside the club backpack" loading="lazy"></figure>
  <div class="included__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Every kit includes</p>
    <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Down to</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">the details.</span></span></h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li><b>Your crest, up front</b><span>Club crest on every piece, with the K mark where it counts.</span></li>
      <li><b>Names &amp; numbers</b><span>Applied per player and packed by player.</span></li>
      <li><b>A supporters' shop</b><span>Your own club shop page, stocked and shipped by us.</span></li>
      <li><b>5% back to the game</b><span>Every kit supports underprivileged football communities.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="faq" data-section="faq">
  <div class="wrap faq__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Good to know</span></span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details><summary>Which clubs do you work with?</summary><p>Clubs at every level: semi-pro and USL League Two sides, academies, high school and college programs, and amateur and Sunday league teams.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can our supporters buy the kit too?</summary><p>Yes. Every custom kit can come with a supporters' shop: hoodies, tees, caps and scarves in your crest and colors, sold online and shipped by us.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you add names and numbers?</summary><p>Yes. Names, numbers and crests are applied piece by piece, and orders arrive packed by player.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does it take?</summary><p>It depends on the range and quantities. We confirm timings with your quote, after samples are approved.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Where does the 5% go?</summary><p>5% of every product sold supports underprivileged football communities: equipment, training, access to programs and the chance for a young player to step onto a field.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ BRIEF ============ -->
<section class="cta" id="brief" data-section="contact-form">
  <div class="wrap cta__grid">
    <div class="cta__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start a brief</p>
      <h2 class="display"><span class="line"><span class="split">Let's build</span></span><span class="line"><span class="split">your kit.</span></span></h2>
      <p class="cta__copy">Tell us about your club and we'll come back with a range, samples and a price per player.</p>
      <div class="brief-picks" id="briefPicks">
        <p class="brief-picks__label">Pieces in your brief</p>
        <ul id="briefList"></ul>
        <p class="brief-picks__empty" id="briefEmpty">No pieces yet. <a href="#builder">Pick from the range</a>, or just tell us what you need.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form class="kit-form" id="kitForm" novalidate>
      <div class="field"><input id="f-club" name="club" required placeholder=" " autocomplete="organization"><label for="f-club">Club name</label></div>
      <div class="field"><input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder=" " autocomplete="email"><label for="f-email">Email</label></div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field"><select id="f-level" name="level"><option>Semi-pro / USL2</option><option>Academy</option><option>High school / College</option><option>Amateur / Sunday league</option></select><label for="f-level" class="is-fixed">Level</label></div>
        <div class="field"><input id="f-squad" name="squad" type="number" min="1" placeholder=" "><label for="f-squad">Squad size</label></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><textarea id="f-notes" name="notes" rows="3" placeholder=" "></textarea><label for="f-notes">Anything else? Colors, deadlines, crest files</label></div>
      <input type="hidden" name="pieces" id="f-pieces">
      <button class="btn btn--indigo btn--full magnetic" type="submit"><span>Send the brief</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      <p class="kit-form__msg" id="formMsg" role="status"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
